Short:    FAME MsgHeader replacement door v1.6.
Uploader: strider@trsi.de (David Wettig)
Author:   strider@trsi.de (David Wettig)
Type:     comm/bbs

FAMEMsgHeader.FIM v1.6 is a FAME door to replace the standard mail header
of the message base in MainPart which apears on reading mails.

Source code included to show how to write your own mail header replacement
door and to show how to code FAME doors.

